<deck-scene id="s9" title="DECIDE ONCE" layout="split"><div>
<h2 class="rise">Decide once.<br><em class="serif">Reuse the answer.</em></h2>
<p class="lede rise">Puzzle and attempt share one date.</p>
<button class="replay rise" data-replay="resolver"><deck-icon name="rotate-ccw"></deck-icon> REPLAY THE CHAIN</button></div>
<div class="diagram rise"><div class="dlabel"><span>ONE RESOLVER</span><span>NO SECOND CLOCK</span></div>
<deck-stack id="resolveStack">
<deck-node label="Instant + zone" note="The request, as it arrived" tag="01"></deck-node>
<deck-node label="Local date key" note="getDateKey(now, zone)" tag="02"></deck-node>
<deck-node label="Exact puzzle, or bounded fallback" note="Never past the key" tag="03"></deck-node>
<deck-node label="Served puzzle date" note="The identity downstream" tag="04"></deck-node>
<deck-node label="Board + attempt" note="Both read from that date" tag="05"></deck-node>
</deck-stack></div></deck-scene>

<deck-scene id="s10" title="DAYS ARE NOT 24 HOURS" layout="split"><div>
<h2 class="rise">A day is not<br><em class="serif">24 hours.</em></h2>
